This ontology fragment defines classes for SlurmDBD Configuration, MySQL Configuration, MySQL User, Database, and SlurmDBD Archive and Purge. It also defines object and datatype properties for these classes to represent the various configuration parameters and actions related to MySQL and SlurmDBD.
